# Keep line endings of bundled SVG and HTML files the same on every platform.
# The build derives output names from the raw bytes of the files it reads, so a
# checkout with CRLF would produce different file names than one with LF.
# The same goes for scripts, components and style sheets, and a shell script
# with CRLF line endings stops working altogether.
*.svg    text eol=lf
*.html   text eol=lf
*.js     text eol=lf
*.svelte text eol=lf
*.css    text eol=lf
*.sh     text eol=lf
